{"4532020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Agro Life", "steam_appid": 4532020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agro Life</strong> is a relaxing low-poly farming simulation where you build, grow, and manage your own countryside life. Start with a small plot of land and turn it into a thriving farm filled with crops, animals, and handcrafted structures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant and harvest crops, take care of livestock, gather resources, craft tools, and expand your farm step by step. Explore the world, hunt, fish, trade with NPCs, and develop your character through experience and progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you prefer peaceful farming or a more active survival-style experience, Agro Life lets you play your way.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agro Life</strong> is a relaxing low-poly farming simulation where you build, grow, and manage your own countryside life. Start with a small plot of land and turn it into a thriving farm filled with crops, animals, and handcrafted structures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant and harvest crops, take care of livestock, gather resources, craft tools, and expand your farm step by step. Explore the world, hunt, fish, trade with NPCs, and develop your character through experience and progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you prefer peaceful farming or a more active survival-style experience, Agro Life lets you play your way.</p>", "short_description": "Agro Life is a relaxing low-poly farming simulation where you grow crops, raise animals, craft tools, and build your own farm while exploring a living world.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532020/0246cff373d311b194da3e5c30e165ecd14d1aae/header.jpg?t=1776347909", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste